        "note_tweet": {
          "entities": {},
          "text": "Lindsay Clancy strangled her three children to death.\n\nShe played with them in the snow.\nOrdered takeout.\nCalled the pharmacy about their medicine.\n\nThen she killed them one by one.\n\nI don’t care if it was postpartum psychosis.\n\nI don’t care about command voices or mental health debates.\n\nThree little kids are gone forever because of what she did.\n\nThey deserved a mother who protected them — not one who took their lives.\n\nShe needs to be held fully accountable.\n\nNo excuses. No soft landing.\nJustice for those babies. That’s it."
        },
